OL,3,GNEWSA'We feel abandoned by police': A
OL,4,Acommunity's despair after months of
OL,5,Acrime
OL,6,
OL,7,FWorking on a busy high street, staff at
OL,8,FSubway in Kings Heath, Birmingham, are
OL,9,Fused to dealing with tricky customers.
OL,11,FTeenagers leaping over the counter to
OL,12,Fsteal entire trays of crisps and
OL,13,Fcookies, however, is not something they
OL,14,Fwere prepared for.
OL,16,FThe fizzy drinks fridge has been
OL,17,Fransacked numerous times over the
OL,18,Fsummer, the front door and windows
OL,19,Fsmashed. Customers who were unfortunate
OL,20,Fto witness the attacks have been
OL,21,Fverbally abused, with one also having
OL,22,Fhis bike vandalised.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,353,350,200,160,0,100
