OL,3,GNEWSA'We feel abandoned by police': A
OL,4,Acommunity's despair after months of
OL,5,Acrime
OL,6,
OL,7,F"We've had a number of staff leave
OL,8,Frecently," one worker says. "They
OL,9,Fshould not have to come to work in
OL,10,Ffear."
